<title>USA: TENNIS-TUESDAY'S RESULTS FROM CARLSBAD WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-TUESDAY'S RESULTS FROM CARLSBAD WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, California 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$450,000 Toshiba Classic women's tennis tournament on Tuesday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>5-Anke Huber (Germany) beat Magdalena Maleeva (Bulgaria) 7-5</p>
<p>1-6 6-3</p>
<p>6-Mary Pierce (France) vs. Amy Frazier (U.S.) 6-3 6-7 (6-8)</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat Anne Miller (U.S.) 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Ai Sugiyama (Japan) beat Alexandra Stevenson (U.S.) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Venus Williams (U.S.) beat Florencia Labat (Argentina) 6-3</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Nathalie Tauziat (France) beat Rita Grande (Italy) 7-5 6-1</p>
<p>Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) Soibhan Drake-Brockman (Australia)</p>
<p>7-5 6-3</p>
</text>
